  "title": "this, call, apply, bind",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "md": "## Four rules (plain functions)\n\n1. `obj.method()` — `this` is `obj`.\n2. `fn()` — `this` is undefined in strict / global in sloppy.\n3. `fn.call(obj)` / `apply` — you pick `this`.\n4. `fn.bind(obj)` — returns a new function with `this` locked.\n\nBind a mover so the callback still walks east."
    },
    {
